      "description": "Water ice can be found on most planets in the Solar System, though not all worlds visited by Stationeers possess this resource. Highly sensitive to temperature, ice will begin to melt as soon as it is mined, unless kept in the Mining Belt. When melting, ice produces a mixture of Steam and Nitrogen gas.",
